			"Message": "docs(Wind): Add comprehensive architecture documentation\n\nIntroduce the `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` file to describe the Wind UI service layer. This document details the Effect-TS native implementation that replaces VS Code's Electron IPC pipeline with typed Tauri commands routed to the Mountain Rust backend.\n\nKey contents include:\n- Overview of the `Preload.ts` shim and `Effect/` service modules.\n- Explanation of the Define/Implement/Problem pattern for service construction.\n- Description of Layer composition (`TauriLiveLayer`, `ElectronLiveLayer`, `TestLayer`).\n- Mapping of Wind services to Mountain Tauri commands via `Effect/Mountain.ts`.\n- Integration flows with the VS Code workbench and Sky UI component layer.\n\nThis documentation serves as the primary reference for the frontend service contracts and architectural boundaries between Wind, Mountain, and Sky.",
			"SHA": "24549234b966e7bf7453cd490ea6ea17a22b2f72"
		},
