			],
			"Message": "chore(Wind): Regenerate service bridges and update catalog versions\n\nSynchronize the Wind UI service layer with the upstream VS Code source to align with the latest interface definitions and catalog states.\n\nKey modifications:\n- Updated `CommandCatalogVersion` and `ServiceCatalogVersion` to \"2026-05-15\" in `Source/Effect/Generated`.\n- Reformatted all generated `*BridgeShape` type definitions across `Source/Effect/*` to use multi-line `Pick` syntax. This improves readability for long method lists and aligns with project style conventions.\n- Adjusted `README.md` diagram labels to remove redundant emojis and place Unicode whitespace characters consistently.\n\nThese changes ensure the Wind service contracts accurately reflect the current upstream registry state and maintain consistent formatting across all generated artifacts.",
			"SHA": "d6a6b9a701b59581a949dc68d9c8db04acf91c33"
		},
